## 15. Quick File Reference

| File | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| `5gc/upf_c_complete/upf.c` | UPF-C main entry (initialisation, PFCP server, ONVM loop). |
| `5gc/upf_c_complete/n4_onvm_pfcp_handler.c` | PFCP message handlers, classifier rebuild/publish logic. |
| `5gc/upf_u_complete/upf_u.c` | UPF-U dataplane NF; packet handler, FAR/QER application, QoS. |
| `5gc/upf_u_complete/upf_u_config.c` | YAML config parser for UPF-U (MAC/IP/ports). |
| `5gc/upf_u/upf_ingress.c` | UPF-U ingress NF; UL inline dataplane, DL enqueue into per-session rings. |
| `5gc/upf_u/upf_egress.c` | UPF-U egress NF; RR scheduler that drains per-session DL rings, applies DL actions/QoS, transmits. |
| `onvm/upf/upf_context.c` | Session context, memzone init, session hash maps. |
| `onvm/upf/upf_session_dl.c` | Per-session DL ring helper (`UpfSessionEnsureDlRing`, ring naming, publish semantics). |
| `onvm/upf/gtp.h` | GTP-U header helpers (`get_teid_gtp_packet`, `get_gtpu_header_len_with_qfi`). |
| `5gc/classifiers/upf_cls_adapter.cpp` | Converts UPDK PDRs to classifier rules. |
| `5gc/classifiers/classifier_wrapper.cpp` | Backend-agnostic classifier API (PartitionSort default). |
| `scripts/build.sh` / `scripts/start.sh` | Build, launch helper scripts. |
| `docs/images/upf-arch.png` | High-level architecture diagram. |

