### Maintainer Notes

- Ensure `onvm-manager` and both UPF NFs agree on service IDs and memzones before rolling updates.
- When transferring this context file, include any environment-specific overrides (e.g. `upfcfg.yaml`, `upf_u.yaml`, `scripts/start.sh` arguments) to reproduce deployments.

